    "longBusinessSummary": "Jp-Holdings,Inc. provides childcare support services in Japan. The company is involved in the operation of child-rearing support facilities, such as nursey schools, after-school clubs, and children's centers, as well as community centers; and development and provision of programs comprising English, gymnastics, rhythmic, dance, and early childhood learning programs. It also engages in the provision of meals for child-rearing support facilities, and advisory services regarding meals; conduction of training and research on childcare and child development; and planning and sale of childcare-related products, such as toy shelves and picture book shelves. In addition, it operates Kodomel, a child-rearing support platform; engages in consignment of food service; provides contract training for child development to corporations and local governments; and manages real estate. Further, the company is involved in food education activities. Jp-Holdings,Inc. was incorporated in 1993 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan.",
